{"id":"chatcmpl-16529498-6214-48cb-bc55-de74a23d983f","object":"chat.completion","created":1795249517,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a multi-tool verification strategy for medical image interpretation, where an expert consultation is cross-validated with grounded reporting and targeted phrase grounding. The pattern emphasizes confirming both the presence and the spatial location of a finding before committing to a side-specific answer. Success comes from triangulating independent evidence sources rather than relying on a single tool output.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question requires choosing between lateralized or localized options, use targeted spatial grounding to confirm the specific location rather than relying on general findings.\",\n    \"Combine a domain-expert consultation with an independent grounded report to cross-validate the same finding before answering.\",\n    \"Use phrase grounding as a final confirmation step to localize the exact candidate answer, converting a general observation into a specific option selection.\",\n    \"Sequence tools from broad (expert question) to structured (grounded report) to narrow (phrase grounding) to progressively reduce ambiguity.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Ask a domain expert tool an open question about the finding and its location first, then corroborate with a structured findings report before narrowing to a specific option.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice localization tasks\": \"When options differ only by side or region, explicitly ground the candidate phrase to verify spatial correspondence with the image.\",\n    \"Multi-tool verification\": \"Chain independent tools that answer the same underlying question in different formats; agreement across them justifies the final answer.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the finding's presence AND its spatial location (side/lobe/region) match the chosen option.\",\n    \"Verify that at least two independent tool outputs agree on the localized finding before finalizing.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":510,"total_tokens":865,"completion_tokens":355,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":510},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":355}}}